{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43341170",
      "title": "Verifying An Active Auth Session",
      "lectureOrder": 216,
      "videoOrder": 202,
      "sourceHash": "25890a0018bcc110391ac273856446becdac840df6073ef8dc8309a3c798b7d0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 1.8,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.8,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "that we cannot just create auth sessions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 7.8,
          "en": "but that we can also verify auth sessions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.8,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "so that we can verify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 13.803,
          "en": "whether a request is coming from a user who did log in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "And for that, in that lib auth.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 22.86,
          "en": "I'll export a new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.86,
          "end": 25.5,
          "en": "a new async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 28.05,
          "en": "which I'll name verifyAuth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.05,
          "end": 30.363,
          "en": "The name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 36.39,
          "en": "This function should check whether an incoming request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 38.61,
          "en": "is coming from an authenticated user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.61,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "So if incoming request has that authentication cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 45.15,
          "en": "and if it's a valid cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "so a cookie with a valid session ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "that we stored on the server in the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 53.01,
          "en": "because just the existence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.01,
          "end": 55.2,
          "en": "of the cookie alone is not enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.2,
          "end": 57.54,
          "en": "It could be a faked cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.54,
          "end": 60.333,
          "en": "We definitely also need to validate it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.26,
          "end": 64.41,
          "en": "Now first, we need to retrieve the cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 66.39,
          "en": "from the incoming request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.39,
          "end": 69.69,
          "en": "and therefore we can again use this cookies function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.69,
          "end": 71.73,
          "en": "and then use get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.73,
          "end": 74.46000000000001,
          "en": "and then use this Lucia object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.46000000000001,
          "end": 76.233,
          "en": "which we create up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.22,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "and access SessionCookieName so that we, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.34,
          "end": 86.55,
          "en": "retrieve the cookie with our session cookie name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.55,
          "end": 89.49,
          "en": "from the incoming request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.49,
          "end": 92.52000000000001,
          "en": "Now this of course might be undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.52000000000001,
          "end": 97.28999999999999,
          "en": "if we get a request without a session cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 99.69,
          "en": "So we have a session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 101.72999999999999,
          "en": "which potentially is undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.72999999999999,
          "end": 103.293,
          "en": "That could be the case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.34,
          "end": 107.82,
          "en": "Therefore I'll check if not sessionCookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.84,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "so if we don't have one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 115.18,
          "en": "and in that case I'll return an object here in verifyAuth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 119.07,
          "en": "where I set the user to null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.65,
          "en": "and the session to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.65,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "and it's up to you what you wanna return here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 126.9,
          "en": "You could also just return false to indicate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.9,
          "end": 131.4,
          "en": "that the request is coming from an unauthenticated user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.4,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "Here I'll return such an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 137.04,
          "en": "which contains no user and session data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.04,
          "end": 139.68,
          "en": "and we can then use that object in our routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.68,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "in our pages to verify whether we did find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "an authenticated user on the request or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 148.893,
          "en": "I'll show you how to use it in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "So that's what I return if I don't have a session cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 156.06,
          "en": "If I do find a session cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 159.12,
          "en": "we got a cookie value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.12,
          "end": 163.32999999999998,
          "en": "So in the end, the session ID you could say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 167.37,
          "en": "and we get that from our session cookie,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.37,
          "end": 170.223,
          "en": "and then there, we can access the value key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.87,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "Now if for some reason we don't have a session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 181.113,
          "en": "I also wanna return this object without user data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.18,
          "end": 184.65,
          "en": "But if we make it past this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.65,
          "end": 187.02,
          "en": "if I know that I have a session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.02,
          "end": 189.24,
          "en": "and that I have a session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.24,
          "end": 194.24,
          "en": "and now as a next step we need to validate this session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.28,
          "end": 197.97,
          "en": "So we need to find out whether it's a valid session ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.97,
          "end": 200.57999999999998,
          "en": "and for that we can use that Lucia object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.57999999999998,
          "end": 202.69,
          "en": "and there call validateSession",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 207.693,
          "en": "and pass our session ID to that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.62,
          "end": 211.53,
          "en": "That will then, in the end, look into the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.53,
          "end": 215.01,
          "en": "and see if it finds a session with that ID in the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.01,
          "end": 217.263,
          "en": "and if that's still a valid session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 219.69,
          "en": "So we'll get back a result here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.69,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "and we need to await this operation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.48,
          "end": 225.573,
          "en": "and that result can now be returned here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.34,
          "end": 229.65,
          "en": "And this result will actually also be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.65,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "an object with a user key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "and a session key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 235.82999999999998,
          "en": "That's why I used that same shape here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 235.82999999999998,
          "end": 238.89,
          "en": "But now if we did validate that session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 238.89,
          "end": 241.2,
          "en": "that will either again be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.2,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "where both is set to null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 245.73,
          "en": "or it will be the actual user data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.73,
          "end": 247.62,
          "en": "so the user ID, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.62,
          "end": 250.113,
          "en": "and some extra data about the session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.16,
          "end": 253.44,
          "en": "So we'll return an object of this shape,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.44,
          "end": 255.78,
          "en": "but user and session will not be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.78,
          "end": 259.203,
          "en": "if we did find out that it is a valid session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 262.29,
          "en": "Now what we should also do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.29,
          "end": 264.12,
          "en": "if we validated a session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.12,
          "end": 267.03,
          "en": "and we found that it's a valid session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 271.92,
          "en": "is we should refresh it so that it stays active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.92,
          "end": 275.64,
          "en": "and the user isn't suddenly locked out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.64,
          "end": 280.47,
          "en": "Therefore we should check if we have a true session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.47,
          "end": 282.03,
          "en": "on that result object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.03,
          "end": 285.69,
          "en": "So we found an active valid session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.69,
          "end": 288.33,
          "en": "and we should then check if that session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 288.33,
          "end": 290.883,
          "en": "has fresh set to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.26,
          "end": 294.03,
          "en": "If that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 294.03,
          "end": 297.52,
          "en": "we can call lucia.createSessionCookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 297.52,
          "end": 300.06,
          "en": "again to create a new session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 300.06,
          "end": 304.53,
          "en": "for the session ID of the session we just retrieved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.53,
          "end": 306.693,
          "en": "so the session we got from our result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 310.47,
          "end": 313.68,
          "en": "and we should then again set that session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 313.68,
          "end": 317.64,
          "en": "just as we did it before when we created it the first time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.64,
          "end": 319.68,
          "en": "That will basically recreate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 319.68,
          "end": 323.79,
          "en": "that cookie for the existing active session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 323.79,
          "end": 326.973,
          "en": "and therefore prolong it you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 328.02,
          "end": 331.29,
          "en": "Now NextJS will actually throw an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 331.29,
          "end": 333.87,
          "en": "if you try to set a cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 333.87,
          "end": 337.44,
          "en": "if you are doing that as part of the page rendering process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 337.44,
          "end": 341.19,
          "en": "and therefore you should wrap this with try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 341.19,
          "end": 342.49,
          "en": "to catch that error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 344.04,
          "end": 345.58,
          "en": "and then do nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 346.68,
          "end": 349.2,
          "en": "because it's actually an error we wanna ignore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 349.2,
          "end": 352.02,
          "en": "because we want to be able to set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 352.02,
          "end": 354.51,
          "en": "that authentication session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 354.51,
          "end": 357.06,
          "en": "even if we're just rendering a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 357.06,
          "end": 360.63,
          "en": "NextJS normally doesn't like it if we set cookies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 360.63,
          "end": 361.86,
          "en": "when rendering a page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.86,
          "end": 363.81,
          "en": "but we like to do it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 363.81,
          "end": 366.96,
          "en": "That is something you find in the Lucia documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366.96,
          "end": 369.873,
          "en": "and therefore we should do it here when using Lucia.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 370.8,
          "end": 374.4,
          "en": "Now it's also possible that we did not find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 374.4,
          "end": 376.95,
          "en": "a session on the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 376.95,
          "end": 378.06,
          "en": "and in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 378.06,
          "end": 382.14,
          "en": "I wanna clear the session cookie that was sent along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 382.14,
          "end": 387.14,
          "en": "because it's clearly not a cookie for a valid session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 387.15,
          "end": 389.34,
          "en": "Therefore we should then again create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 389.34,
          "end": 391.17,
          "en": "new session cookie data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 391.17,
          "end": 393.09000000000003,
          "en": "but we should do that with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.09000000000003,
          "end": 397.533,
          "en": "of the createBlankSessionCookie method provided by Lucia.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 398.58,
          "end": 401.15999999999997,
          "en": "And then again, we should call cookies set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.15999999999997,
          "end": 403.05,
          "en": "and use the sessionCookie data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.05,
          "end": 405.78,
          "en": "but this will now, as I just explained,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.78,
          "end": 409.47,
          "en": "basically clear that existing cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 409.47,
          "end": 412.89300000000003,
          "en": "because it contained invalid session data anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 414.15,
          "end": 415.68,
          "en": "And that's the operand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 415.68,
          "end": 418.95,
          "en": "That's all we should do here in verifyAuth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
